          "page": "1",
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "The yield strength prediction in a wide range of temperatures (20–800◦C) was made using a surrogate model based on a support-vector machine algorithm. The yield strength at 20◦C and 600◦C was predicted quite precisely (the average prediction error was 11% and 13.5%, respectively) with a decrease in the precision to slightly higher than 20% at 800◦C.",
